-- Tests for the Commitment 9 encoding, with expected values written by hand from the
-- source text and a calendar. The arithmetic for every date is in NOTES.md
-- ("How the expected dates were worked out"); none was copied from l4's output.
--
-- DRAFT. Not for use as advice.
-- Every assertion here is expected to be satisfied. A failure is a finding.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `cop-domain`
IMPORT `cop-commitment-9`
IMPORT `cop-seat`

-- The YMD shim: the stable prelude has no YMD (docs/ENCODING-GUIDE.md, section 5).
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, m IS A NUMBER, d IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DATE
YMD y m d MEANS Date d m y

§ `Fixtures`

`no link`     MEANS `no such harm, or no link to my model`
`involvement` MEANS `my model's involvement led to it, directly or indirectly`
`suspicion`   MEANS `I establish or suspect with reasonable likelihood that my model caused it`

-- An incident, harms in the order of the record: critical infrastructure, cybersecurity,
-- death, health, fundamental rights, property, environment; then the awareness date and
-- whether exceptional circumstances apply.
GIVEN ci IS A `my model's link to a harm`, cy IS A `my model's link to a harm`
      de IS A `my model's link to a harm`, he IS A `my model's link to a harm`
      fr IS A `my model's link to a harm`, pr IS A `my model's link to a harm`
      en IS A `my model's link to a harm`
      aw IS A DATE, ex IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `the incident as I know it`
`an incident` ci cy de he fr pr en aw ex MEANS
    `the incident as I know it` WITH
        `link to a serious and irreversible disruption of the management or operation of critical infrastructure` IS ci
        `link to a serious cybersecurity breach`                            IS cy
        `link to the death of a person`                                     IS de
        `link to serious harm to a person's health`                         IS he
        `link to an infringement of Union-law obligations that protect fundamental rights` IS fr
        `link to serious harm to property`                                  IS pr
        `link to serious harm to the environment`                           IS en
        `the date I became aware of my model's involvement in the incident` IS aw
        `exceptional circumstances apply`                                   IS ex

`aware on 2 March 2026` MEANS YMD 2026 3 2

`the critical infrastructure incident` MEANS `an incident` `involvement` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` `aware on 2 March 2026` FALSE
`the cybersecurity incident`           MEANS `an incident` `no link` `involvement` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` `aware on 2 March 2026` FALSE
`the death`                            MEANS `an incident` `no link` `no link` `involvement` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` `aware on 2 March 2026` FALSE
`the harm to health`                   MEANS `an incident` `no link` `no link` `no link` `involvement` `no link` `no link` `no link` `aware on 2 March 2026` FALSE

GIVEN rect IS A BOOLEAN, h IS A MAYBE DATE, r IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A `my corrective measures`
`measures` rect h r MEANS
    `my corrective measures` WITH
        `rectifying the harm is possible`                                   IS rect
        `the date I adopted corrective measures to rectify the harm`        IS h
        `the date I adopted corrective measures to assess and mitigate the related systemic risks` IS r

`initial items` MEANS LIST `item 1, start and end dates`, `item 2, resulting harm and victims`, `item 3, chain of events`, `item 4, model involved`, `item 5, material on the model's involvement`, `item 6, what I intend to do or have done`, `item 7, what I recommend the authorities do`
`items 1 to 6` MEANS LIST `item 1, start and end dates`, `item 2, resulting harm and victims`, `item 3, chain of events`, `item 4, model involved`, `item 5, material on the model's involvement`, `item 6, what I intend to do or have done`
`all nine items` MEANS LIST `item 1, start and end dates`, `item 2, resulting harm and victims`, `item 3, chain of events`, `item 4, model involved`, `item 5, material on the model's involvement`, `item 6, what I intend to do or have done`, `item 7, what I recommend the authorities do`, `item 8, root cause analysis`, `item 9, patterns from post-market monitoring`

§ `The Code's status`

-- Objective A: adherence is not conclusive evidence of compliance.
#ASSERT `adhering to the Code is conclusive evidence of compliance with Articles 53 and 55 AI Act` EQUALS FALSE

#ASSERT `does this Code bind me` TRUE TRUE EQUALS `the Chapter binds me`
#ASSERT `does this Code bind me` FALSE TRUE EQUALS `the Chapter does not bind me, because I am not a Signatory`
#ASSERT `does this Code bind me` TRUE FALSE EQUALS `the Chapter is not relevant here, because the model is not a general-purpose AI model with systemic risk`
#ASSERT `does this Code bind me` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `the Chapter does not bind me, because I am not a Signatory`

§ `Measure 9.3, the initial-report clocks`

-- A non-Signatory: "this Code does not bind me", whatever happened.
#ASSERT `by when must I make my initial report` FALSE TRUE `involvement` `no link` `involvement` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` (YMD 2026 3 2) FALSE EQUALS `no initial report is due, because the Chapter does not bind me`
-- A Signatory whose model is not a general-purpose AI model with systemic risk: the
-- reason must be the one "Does this Code bind me?" gives. Until 2026-10-24 this line
-- expected "because the Chapter does not bind me", the same wrong label the rules gave,
-- so it could not catch it; the coordinator's review did.
#ASSERT `by when must I make my initial report` TRUE FALSE `involvement` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` (YMD 2026 3 2) FALSE EQUALS `no initial report is due, because the model is not a general-purpose AI model with systemic risk`
-- The same check written so that it also runs against the rules before the fix, where
-- it fails: the reason given is not the non-Signatory's.
#ASSERT (NOT (`by when must I make my initial report` TRUE FALSE `involvement` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` (YMD 2026 3 2) FALSE EQUALS `no initial report is due, because the Chapter does not bind me`))
#ASSERT (NOT (`when is my next intermediate report due` TRUE FALSE (JUST (YMD 2026 3 4)) NOTHING TRUE NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS `no intermediate report is due, because the Chapter does not bind me`))
#ASSERT (NOT (`when is my final report due` TRUE FALSE TRUE (JUST (YMD 2026 3 25)) (JUST (YMD 2026 3 20)) EQUALS `no final report is due, because the Chapter does not bind me`))
#ASSERT (NOT (`how long must I keep the records` TRUE FALSE (YMD 2026 3 10) (YMD 2026 3 1) NOTHING EQUALS `no retention duty, because the Chapter does not bind me`))

-- Point (1): two days. Aware 2 March 2026: last day 4 March.
#ASSERT `by when must I make my initial report` TRUE TRUE `involvement` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` (YMD 2026 3 2) FALSE EQUALS `report by the last day one point allows` (`an applicable clock` OF `point 1, critical infrastructure`, YMD 2026 3 4)
#ASSERT `submitted in time` (YMD 2026 3 4) (`the last day to report under the point` `point 1, critical infrastructure` `the critical infrastructure incident`)
#ASSERT (NOT (`submitted in time` (YMD 2026 3 5) (`the last day to report under the point` `point 1, critical infrastructure` `the critical infrastructure incident`)))
-- the suspicion route starts the same clock
#ASSERT `by when must I make my initial report` TRUE TRUE `suspicion` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` (YMD 2026 3 2) FALSE EQUALS `report by the last day one point allows` (`an applicable clock` OF `point 1, critical infrastructure`, YMD 2026 3 4)
-- across a month end: aware 31 January 2026, last day 2 February
#ASSERT `by when must I make my initial report` TRUE TRUE `involvement` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` (YMD 2026 1 31) FALSE EQUALS `report by the last day one point allows` (`an applicable clock` OF `point 1, critical infrastructure`, YMD 2026 2 2)
-- into a leap day: aware 27 February 2028, last day 29 February
#ASSERT `by when must I make my initial report` TRUE TRUE `involvement` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` (YMD 2028 2 27) FALSE EQUALS `report by the last day one point allows` (`an applicable clock` OF `point 1, critical infrastructure`, YMD 2028 2 29)

-- Point (2): five days. Last day 7 March; 8 March is late.
#ASSERT `by when must I make my initial report` TRUE TRUE `no link` `involvement` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` (YMD 2026 3 2) FALSE EQUALS `report by the last day one point allows` (`an applicable clock` OF `point 2, cybersecurity breach`, YMD 2026 3 7)
#ASSERT `submitted in time` (YMD 2026 3 7) (`the last day to report under the point` `point 2, cybersecurity breach` `the cybersecurity incident`)
#ASSERT (NOT (`submitted in time` (YMD 2026 3 8) (`the last day to report under the point` `point 2, cybersecurity breach` `the cybersecurity incident`)))
-- across a leap day: aware 27 February 2028, last day 3 March 2028
#ASSERT `by when must I make my initial report` TRUE TRUE `no link` `suspicion` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` (YMD 2028 2 27) FALSE EQUALS `report by the last day one point allows` (`an applicable clock` OF `point 2, cybersecurity breach`, YMD 2028 3 3)

-- Point (3): ten days. Last day 12 March; 13 March is late.
#ASSERT `by when must I make my initial report` TRUE TRUE `no link` `no link` `involvement` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` (YMD 2026 3 2) FALSE EQUALS `report by the last day one point allows` (`an applicable clock` OF `point 3, death`, YMD 2026 3 12)
#ASSERT `submitted in time` (YMD 2026 3 12) (`the last day to report under the point` `point 3, death` `the death`)
#ASSERT (NOT (`submitted in time` (YMD 2026 3 13) (`the last day to report under the point` `point 3, death` `the death`)))
#ASSERT `by when must I make my initial report` TRUE TRUE `no link` `no link` `suspicion` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` (YMD 2026 3 2) FALSE EQUALS `report by the last day one point allows` (`an applicable clock` OF `point 3, death`, YMD 2026 3 12)

-- Point (4): fifteen days, for each of its four harms. Last day 17 March; 18 March is late.
#ASSERT `by when must I make my initial report` TRUE TRUE `no link` `no link` `no link` `involvement` `no link` `no link` `no link` (YMD 2026 3 2) FALSE EQUALS `report by the last day one point allows` (`an applicable clock` OF `point 4, health, fundamental rights, property or environment`, YMD 2026 3 17)
#ASSERT `by when must I make my initial report` TRUE TRUE `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` `suspicion` `no link` `no link` (YMD 2026 3 2) FALSE EQUALS `report by the last day one point allows` (`an applicable clock` OF `point 4, health, fundamental rights, property or environment`, YMD 2026 3 17)
#ASSERT `by when must I make my initial report` TRUE TRUE `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` `involvement` `no link` (YMD 2026 3 2) FALSE EQUALS `report by the last day one point allows` (`an applicable clock` OF `point 4, health, fundamental rights, property or environment`, YMD 2026 3 17)
#ASSERT `by when must I make my initial report` TRUE TRUE `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` `involvement` (YMD 2026 3 2) FALSE EQUALS `report by the last day one point allows` (`an applicable clock` OF `point 4, health, fundamental rights, property or environment`, YMD 2026 3 17)
#ASSERT `submitted in time` (YMD 2026 3 17) (`the last day to report under the point` `point 4, health, fundamental rights, property or environment` `the harm to health`)
#ASSERT (NOT (`submitted in time` (YMD 2026 3 18) (`the last day to report under the point` `point 4, health, fundamental rights, property or environment` `the harm to health`)))
-- across a year end: aware 20 December 2026, last day 4 January 2027
#ASSERT `by when must I make my initial report` TRUE TRUE `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` `involvement` `no link` (YMD 2026 12 20) FALSE EQUALS `report by the last day one point allows` (`an applicable clock` OF `point 4, health, fundamental rights, property or environment`, YMD 2027 1 4)

-- No point applies: no harm, or no link to my model.
#ASSERT `by when must I make my initial report` TRUE TRUE `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` (YMD 2026 3 2) FALSE EQUALS `no initial report is due under Measure 9.3, because none of its points applies`
-- Exceptional circumstances: the Code sets no deadline, so none is given.
#ASSERT `by when must I make my initial report` TRUE TRUE `no link` `no link` `involvement` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` (YMD 2026 3 2) TRUE EQUALS `the Code sets no deadline, because exceptional circumstances apply`
#ASSERT `by when must I make my initial report` TRUE TRUE `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` (YMD 2026 3 2) TRUE EQUALS `no initial report is due under Measure 9.3, because none of its points applies`

-- More than one point: the Code does not say which clock governs (F9).
-- Critical infrastructure and a death: 4 March (point 1) and 12 March (point 3).
#ASSERT `by when must I make my initial report` TRUE TRUE `involvement` `no link` `involvement` `no link` `no link` `no link` `no link` (YMD 2026 3 2) FALSE EQUALS `more than one point applies, and the Code does not say which clock governs` OF (LIST (`an applicable clock` OF `point 1, critical infrastructure`, YMD 2026 3 4), (`an applicable clock` OF `point 3, death`, YMD 2026 3 12)), YMD 2026 3 4, YMD 2026 3 12
-- A death and harm to health: 12 March (point 3) and 17 March (point 4).
#ASSERT `by when must I make my initial report` TRUE TRUE `no link` `no link` `involvement` `suspicion` `no link` `no link` `no link` (YMD 2026 3 2) FALSE EQUALS `more than one point applies, and the Code does not say which clock governs` OF (LIST (`an applicable clock` OF `point 3, death`, YMD 2026 3 12), (`an applicable clock` OF `point 4, health, fundamental rights, property or environment`, YMD 2026 3 17)), YMD 2026 3 12, YMD 2026 3 17
-- Two harms under point (4) alone are one point, so one clock.
#ASSERT `by when must I make my initial report` TRUE TRUE `no link` `no link` `no link` `involvement` `no link` `involvement` `no link` (YMD 2026 3 2) FALSE EQUALS `report by the last day one point allows` (`an applicable clock` OF `point 4, health, fundamental rights, property or environment`, YMD 2026 3 17)

§ `Measure 9.2 and 9.3, what a report must give`

#ASSERT `does my report give the required information` `an initial report` `initial items` EMPTY
#ASSERT `does my report give the required information` `an initial report` `items 1 to 6` (LIST `item 7, what I recommend the authorities do`)
#ASSERT (NOT (`does my report give the required information` `an initial report` `items 1 to 6` EMPTY))
#ASSERT (NOT (`does my report give the required information` `a final report` `initial items` EMPTY))
#ASSERT `does my report give the required information` `a final report` `initial items` (LIST `item 8, root cause analysis`, `item 9, patterns from post-market monitoring`)
#ASSERT `does my report give the required information` `a final report` `all nine items` EMPTY

§ `Measure 9.3, intermediate reports`

-- 'resolved' from the corrective measures.
#ASSERT `the date the incident was resolved` (`measures` TRUE (JUST (YMD 2026 3 25)) (JUST (YMD 2026 3 20))) EQUALS JUST (YMD 2026 3 25)
#ASSERT `the date the incident was resolved` (`measures` TRUE (JUST (YMD 2026 3 10)) (JUST (YMD 2026 3 20))) EQUALS JUST (YMD 2026 3 20)
#ASSERT `the date the incident was resolved` (`measures` TRUE NOTHING (JUST (YMD 2026 3 20))) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the date the incident was resolved` (`measures` FALSE NOTHING (JUST (YMD 2026 3 20))) EQUALS JUST (YMD 2026 3 20)
#ASSERT `the date the incident was resolved` (`measures` TRUE (JUST (YMD 2026 3 25)) NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING

-- Initial report 4 March 2026, unresolved: next intermediate by 1 April (28 days).
#ASSERT `when is my next intermediate report due` TRUE TRUE (JUST (YMD 2026 3 4)) NOTHING TRUE NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS `my next intermediate report is due by` (YMD 2026 4 1)
#ASSERT `submitted in time` (YMD 2026 4 1) ((YMD 2026 3 4) PLUS `the days between intermediate reports`)
#ASSERT (NOT (`submitted in time` (YMD 2026 4 2) ((YMD 2026 3 4) PLUS `the days between intermediate reports`)))
-- after an intermediate report on 20 March: next by 17 April
#ASSERT `when is my next intermediate report due` TRUE TRUE (JUST (YMD 2026 3 4)) (JUST (YMD 2026 3 20)) TRUE NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS `my next intermediate report is due by` (YMD 2026 4 17)
-- an intermediate date earlier than the initial report is not the latest report
#ASSERT `when is my next intermediate report due` TRUE TRUE (JUST (YMD 2026 3 4)) (JUST (YMD 2026 3 1)) TRUE NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS `my next intermediate report is due by` (YMD 2026 4 1)
-- resolved on 25 March, before 1 April: none due
#ASSERT `when is my next intermediate report due` TRUE TRUE (JUST (YMD 2026 3 4)) NOTHING FALSE NOTHING (JUST (YMD 2026 3 25)) EQUALS `no intermediate report is due, because the incident was resolved by the day it would fall due`
-- resolved on the due day itself, 1 April: none due (F11)
#ASSERT `when is my next intermediate report due` TRUE TRUE (JUST (YMD 2026 3 4)) NOTHING FALSE NOTHING (JUST (YMD 2026 4 1)) EQUALS `no intermediate report is due, because the incident was resolved by the day it would fall due`
-- resolved on 2 April, the day after: the 1 April report was owed
#ASSERT `when is my next intermediate report due` TRUE TRUE (JUST (YMD 2026 3 4)) NOTHING FALSE NOTHING (JUST (YMD 2026 4 2)) EQUALS `my next intermediate report is due by` (YMD 2026 4 1)
-- harm rectifiable but not yet rectified: still unresolved
#ASSERT `when is my next intermediate report due` TRUE TRUE (JUST (YMD 2026 3 4)) NOTHING TRUE NOTHING (JUST (YMD 2026 3 25)) EQUALS `my next intermediate report is due by` (YMD 2026 4 1)
#ASSERT `when is my next intermediate report due` TRUE TRUE NOTHING NOTHING TRUE NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS `no intermediate report is due yet, because I have made no initial report`
#ASSERT `when is my next intermediate report due` FALSE TRUE (JUST (YMD 2026 3 4)) NOTHING TRUE NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS `no intermediate report is due, because the Chapter does not bind me`
#ASSERT `when is my next intermediate report due` TRUE FALSE (JUST (YMD 2026 3 4)) NOTHING TRUE NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS `no intermediate report is due, because the model is not a general-purpose AI model with systemic risk`

§ `Measure 9.3, final report`

-- Resolved 25 March 2026: final report by 24 May (60 days); 25 May is late.
#ASSERT `when is my final report due` TRUE TRUE TRUE (JUST (YMD 2026 3 25)) (JUST (YMD 2026 3 20)) EQUALS `my final report is due by` (YMD 2026 5 24)
#ASSERT `submitted in time` (YMD 2026 5 24) ((YMD 2026 3 25) PLUS `the days allowed for the final report`)
#ASSERT (NOT (`submitted in time` (YMD 2026 5 25) ((YMD 2026 3 25) PLUS `the days allowed for the final report`)))
-- harm cannot be rectified; systemic-risk measures on 20 March: by 19 May
#ASSERT `when is my final report due` TRUE TRUE FALSE NOTHING (JUST (YMD 2026 3 20)) EQUALS `my final report is due by` (YMD 2026 5 19)
#ASSERT `when is my final report due` TRUE TRUE TRUE NOTHING (JUST (YMD 2026 3 20)) EQUALS `no final report date yet, because the incident is unresolved`
#ASSERT `when is my final report due` FALSE TRUE TRUE (JUST (YMD 2026 3 25)) (JUST (YMD 2026 3 20)) EQUALS `no final report is due, because the Chapter does not bind me`
#ASSERT `when is my final report due` TRUE FALSE TRUE (JUST (YMD 2026 3 25)) (JUST (YMD 2026 3 20)) EQUALS `no final report is due, because the model is not a general-purpose AI model with systemic risk`

§ `Measure 9.3, multiple similar serious incidents`

-- First incident's initial report due 4 March 2026, first incident unresolved.
#ASSERT `may I report a similar incident with the first` TRUE TRUE TRUE (YMD 2026 3 4) (YMD 2026 3 4) NOTHING EQUALS `may I report a later similar incident with the first` OF TRUE, TRUE
#ASSERT `may I report a similar incident with the first` TRUE TRUE TRUE (YMD 2026 3 5) (YMD 2026 3 4) NOTHING EQUALS `may I report a later similar incident with the first` OF FALSE, TRUE
-- First incident's final report due 24 May 2026.
#ASSERT `may I report a similar incident with the first` TRUE TRUE TRUE (YMD 2026 5 24) (YMD 2026 3 4) (JUST (YMD 2026 5 24)) EQUALS `may I report a later similar incident with the first` OF FALSE, TRUE
#ASSERT `may I report a similar incident with the first` TRUE TRUE TRUE (YMD 2026 5 25) (YMD 2026 3 4) (JUST (YMD 2026 5 24)) EQUALS `may I report a later similar incident with the first` OF FALSE, FALSE
#ASSERT `may I report a similar incident with the first` TRUE TRUE FALSE (YMD 2026 3 3) (YMD 2026 3 4) NOTHING EQUALS `may I report a later similar incident with the first` OF FALSE, FALSE
#ASSERT `may I report a similar incident with the first` FALSE TRUE TRUE (YMD 2026 3 3) (YMD 2026 3 4) NOTHING EQUALS `may I report a later similar incident with the first` OF FALSE, FALSE

§ `Measure 9.4, retention`

-- Documentation dated 10 March 2026 after a one-day incident on 1 March: 10 March 2031.
#ASSERT `how long must I keep the records` TRUE TRUE (YMD 2026 3 10) (YMD 2026 3 1) NOTHING EQUALS `keep it at least until` OF YMD 2031 3 10, YMD 2031 3 10
-- The incident ran 1 March to 15 April 2026 (F14): 10 March 2031 on the start-date
-- reading, 15 April 2031 on the end-date reading.
#ASSERT `how long must I keep the records` TRUE TRUE (YMD 2026 3 10) (YMD 2026 3 1) (JUST (YMD 2026 4 15)) EQUALS `keep it at least until` OF YMD 2031 3 10, YMD 2031 4 15
-- The incident is the later date: documentation 5 January, incident 1 February 2026.
#ASSERT `how long must I keep the records` TRUE TRUE (YMD 2026 1 5) (YMD 2026 2 1) NOTHING EQUALS `keep it at least until` OF YMD 2031 2 1, YMD 2031 2 1
-- the same day for both: five years from it
#ASSERT `how long must I keep the records` TRUE TRUE (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2026 3 1) NOTHING EQUALS `keep it at least until` OF YMD 2031 3 1, YMD 2031 3 1
-- from a leap day: 28 February 2033, the encoding's choice (F15)
#ASSERT `how long must I keep the records` TRUE TRUE (YMD 2028 2 29) (YMD 2028 2 1) NOTHING EQUALS `keep it at least until` OF YMD 2033 2 28, YMD 2033 2 28
#ASSERT `how long must I keep the records` FALSE TRUE (YMD 2026 3 10) (YMD 2026 3 1) NOTHING EQUALS `no retention duty, because the Chapter does not bind me`
#ASSERT `how long must I keep the records` TRUE FALSE (YMD 2026 3 10) (YMD 2026 3 1) NOTHING EQUALS `no retention duty, because the model is not a general-purpose AI model with systemic risk`

§ `Measure 9.1`

`identification` MEANS `my incident identification` WITH
    `I consider the exemplary methods in Measure 3.5`                   IS TRUE
    `I review other sources such as police and media reports, social media, research papers and incident databases` IS TRUE
    `direct reporting channels are available`                           IS TRUE
    `I inform third parties of the direct reporting channels`           IS TRUE

`identification, no channel told` MEANS `my incident identification` WITH
    `I consider the exemplary methods in Measure 3.5`                   IS TRUE
    `I review other sources such as police and media reports, social media, research papers and incident databases` IS TRUE
    `direct reporting channels are available`                           IS TRUE
    `I inform third parties of the direct reporting channels`           IS FALSE

`identification, no channel exists` MEANS `my incident identification` WITH
    `I consider the exemplary methods in Measure 3.5`                   IS TRUE
    `I review other sources such as police and media reports, social media, research papers and incident databases` IS TRUE
    `direct reporting channels are available`                           IS FALSE
    `I inform third parties of the direct reporting channels`           IS FALSE

`identification, no other sources` MEANS `my incident identification` WITH
    `I consider the exemplary methods in Measure 3.5`                   IS TRUE
    `I review other sources such as police and media reports, social media, research papers and incident databases` IS FALSE
    `direct reporting channels are available`                           IS TRUE
    `I inform third parties of the direct reporting channels`           IS TRUE

#ASSERT `I meet Measure 9.1` `identification`
#ASSERT (NOT (`I meet Measure 9.1` `identification, no channel told`))
#ASSERT `I meet Measure 9.1` `identification, no channel exists`
#ASSERT (NOT (`I meet Measure 9.1` `identification, no other sources`))
